WEBVTT

00:01.330 --> 00:05.170
Yakkity-yak, yakkity-yak, yakkity-yak.

00:06.460 --> 00:08.170
Little bottles!

00:08.170 --> 00:10.460
Get yer little bottles here!

00:13.290 --> 00:14.880
LITTLE BOTTLES!

00:14.880 --> 00:17.130
LITTLE BOTTLES FOR SALE!

00:18.880 --> 00:20.000
Dangnabbit!

00:20.000 --> 00:22.540
Ain't nobody been buying my bottles all day!

00:22.540 --> 00:26.540
I feel like such a dingus for wasting
all that time making 'em!

00:26.920 --> 00:27.920
Huh?

00:32.250 --> 00:33.880
Howdy, little fella!

00:34.580 --> 00:36.330
That's a nice lollipop, ya got there!

00:36.330 --> 00:38.080
Mind tradin' it fer one of my bottles?

00:38.080 --> 00:40.040
What? No way!

00:40.040 --> 00:41.790
I don't need yer bottle.

00:41.790 --> 00:42.630
Wait!

00:42.630 --> 00:43.920
C'mon, little fella!

00:43.920 --> 00:45.630
This ain't no ordinary bottle!

00:45.630 --> 00:48.500
It can shrink anything down,
no matter how big!

00:48.500 --> 00:50.500
It's state-of-the-art technology, I tells ya!

00:54.330 --> 00:56.460
Pleasure doin' business!

00:56.830 --> 00:59.460
The label has all the instructions on it!

00:59.460 --> 01:01.830
Make sure ya give it a good read, okay?

01:03.710 --> 01:06.380
I'm gonna show this off to Lum tomorrow!

01:07.790 --> 01:09.960
<b>Big Bottle, Little Bottle</b>

01:10.750 --> 01:14.830
Tomaranai koi no wana ni toriko ne muchuu ni

01:14.830 --> 01:17.580
Yosomi darling dame dame yo

01:17.580 --> 01:20.920
Itai no tondeke nokoru no ai dake

01:20.920 --> 01:23.710
Kyun to atashi no koigokoro

01:34.960 --> 01:37.920
Hitori wa kirai fureru dake de

01:37.920 --> 01:40.960
Tsunagaru you jan suki na kanji jan

01:40.960 --> 01:44.000
Mawari no iya na iken kankei nai

01:44.000 --> 01:47.130
Iwayuru ano moumoku na no

01:47.130 --> 01:50.790
Saikou na fashion sense atashi ni narenai

01:50.790 --> 01:54.170
Uruyamashii? Kanashii? Kono hanashii

01:54.170 --> 01:56.830
Mention de tsutaeru kimochi

01:56.830 --> 02:00.830
Hora kotoba de tsutaete hoshii no

02:00.830 --> 02:04.960
Tomaranai koi no wana ni toriko ne muchuu ni

02:04.960 --> 02:07.630
Yosomi darling dame dame yo

02:07.630 --> 02:11.080
Itai no tondeke nokoru no ai dake

02:11.080 --> 02:13.460
Kore mo tsurai kedo

02:13.460 --> 02:16.670
Damashite yumeyume ni obore

02:16.670 --> 02:19.920
Mou toushindai no ai wa nai yo

02:20.130 --> 02:23.210
Koi no wana ni toriko ne muchuu ni

02:23.210 --> 02:25.960
Kyun to atashi no koigokoro

02:26.170 --> 02:27.750
La la la la la

02:27.750 --> 02:29.210
Byouteki I need you

02:29.210 --> 02:30.880
La la la la la

02:30.880 --> 02:32.210
Kodoku wa yamai

02:32.210 --> 02:33.830
La la la la la

02:33.830 --> 02:35.380
Moumoku I need you

02:35.380 --> 02:38.290
Zutto anata ni I wanna muchuu

02:42.000 --> 02:45.960
How's a kid like me supposed to
understand all this complicated writing?

02:47.790 --> 02:48.790
I got it open!

02:49.630 --> 02:51.630
What're you up to, little Ten?

02:51.630 --> 02:54.380
Check it out!
I picked this up in the 4D forest!

03:00.460 --> 03:03.540
Lum? Where'd ya disappear to, Lum?!

03:03.920 --> 03:05.210
I'm here, Ten!

03:07.920 --> 03:09.250
Where's here?

03:09.250 --> 03:10.710
Look down!

03:11.000 --> 03:13.790
Why do you always buy
such ridiculous toys?!

03:13.790 --> 03:16.290
LUM TURNED ALL TINY!

03:16.290 --> 03:19.380
Jeez! It's so uncomfortable
and I can't get out!

03:19.380 --> 03:21.670
But I didn't buy it, I got it for tra-

03:22.170 --> 03:23.210
<b>KERSMASH!</b>

03:24.500 --> 03:26.750
"Never point in the direction of a person."

03:26.750 --> 03:29.170
LOOK! IT'S WRITTEN RIGHT HERE!

03:29.580 --> 03:31.580
I'm really sorry, Lum...

03:31.580 --> 03:35.290
"And in the event you wish to return
a small sized item back to its normal size,

03:35.290 --> 03:38.460
please purchase the Big Bottle
(sold separately)."

03:40.960 --> 03:43.250
All right, Ten...

03:43.250 --> 03:45.630
GET MOVING!
YOU NEED TO BUY IT RIGHT NOW!

03:45.630 --> 03:46.750
OKAY!

03:47.330 --> 03:49.500
I can't believe this...

03:51.460 --> 03:53.540
Whew. I'm starving.

03:53.540 --> 03:56.460
Gotta eat something, gotta eat something.

03:56.460 --> 03:57.380
Darlin-

03:58.580 --> 04:00.250
<b>Maison Ikkoku</b>

03:58.960 --> 04:00.250
I finally got my hands on this.

04:02.580 --> 04:04.330
<b>WHAP</b>

04:06.670 --> 04:08.960
<b>Munch</b>

04:07.790 --> 04:09.290
Stop eating!

04:09.290 --> 04:11.080
The hell are you doing?

04:11.080 --> 04:12.420
Well, you see...

04:12.750 --> 04:13.920
Wait a second.

04:13.920 --> 04:17.130
This could be a good chance to have
darling pamper me a little for once!

04:17.580 --> 04:19.080
I have bad news, darling.

04:19.080 --> 04:21.630
I got infected with an illness
that makes me shrink.

04:21.630 --> 04:22.540
Huh?

04:22.880 --> 04:25.380
And the only way for me
to go back to normal...

04:25.790 --> 04:30.500
is for you to shower me with
lots of love and affection.

04:31.750 --> 04:34.460
Lots of... love...?

04:35.920 --> 04:37.080
Gosh.

04:37.080 --> 04:40.250
You aliens sure have to deal with
some crazy illnesses, huh?

04:40.250 --> 04:43.500
Well, you being so small
does help with our food budget.

04:43.750 --> 04:46.170
But I hope you get back to normal soon.

04:46.170 --> 04:48.380
It's okay, because darling
is going to help me!

04:48.380 --> 04:49.290
Hmph!

04:49.830 --> 04:52.250
That's the spirit! Make sure you eat up!

04:52.250 --> 04:54.250
She needs lots of love?

04:54.250 --> 04:56.040
Sounds awfully convenient.

04:56.040 --> 04:57.750
Here, darling! Say "ahh"!

05:00.380 --> 05:03.630
I covered it with a healthy amount
of delicious habanero powder!

05:03.630 --> 05:05.830
What the flying hell?! Damn you!

05:06.790 --> 05:09.750
I can't turn back to normal
unless you show me lots of affection!

05:09.750 --> 05:10.830
Who cares?!

05:10.830 --> 05:13.500
You're better off being no bigger than a fly!

05:14.000 --> 05:15.420
<b>MAISON IKKOKU</b>

05:14.000 --> 05:15.420
<b>When disaster approaches, yet you are stuck between</b>

05:14.000 --> 05:15.420
<b>duty and compassion and cannot move forward or back,</b>

05:14.000 --> 05:15.420
<b>remember that honesty is the best policy.</b>

05:16.130 --> 05:19.420
Yeesh, this guy needs to learn to
make up his mind.

05:36.880 --> 05:38.170
<b>MAISON IKKOKU VOL. 5</b>

05:36.880 --> 05:38.170
<b>-DAY AND NIGHT AT MAISON IKKOKU-</b>

05:40.460 --> 05:41.630
Dummy.

05:41.630 --> 05:43.960
My head isn't a sofa for you
to lounge around on!

05:43.960 --> 05:45.380
Meanie!

05:46.630 --> 05:48.380
Is this where you're sleeping tonight?

05:48.380 --> 05:52.750
It would be really hard to fly back
to my spaceship at this size.

05:54.130 --> 05:56.380
I ain't buying this "lots of love" cure.

05:56.380 --> 05:58.000
She's just screwing with me.

06:12.330 --> 06:14.420
Oops, gotta be careful.

06:17.710 --> 06:20.710
You didn't get into another fight
with Lum, did you, dude?

06:20.710 --> 06:22.210
Make sure you come with her tomorrow!

06:22.210 --> 06:24.210
Not my problem! Ask her yourself!

06:24.210 --> 06:26.210
Whatever. Catch ya later.

06:27.130 --> 06:30.880
Can she really not turn back to normal
without my affection...?

06:31.500 --> 06:35.170
I mean, sometimes she's
serious about this stuff.

06:36.500 --> 06:39.250
Are you saying that you're worried about me?

06:39.880 --> 06:40.960
That's Lum's voice...

06:41.790 --> 06:43.170
Well, everything's fine!

06:43.170 --> 06:47.420
Ten already left to buy a bottle
that can return me to normal.

06:47.420 --> 06:50.000
But keep that a secret from my darling, okay?

06:50.000 --> 06:52.670
That little shit! I knew it!

06:53.750 --> 06:55.000
What are you doing?!

06:55.000 --> 06:57.380
Shaddup! You were trying to bamboozle me!

06:57.380 --> 06:59.630
I overheard you telling
Kotatsu Cat all about it!

07:00.290 --> 07:01.580
So, you stay here...

07:01.580 --> 07:04.290
while I go off to pick up some chicks!

07:04.290 --> 07:07.630
I can't believe you! Jerk!

07:09.710 --> 07:11.250
Dumb darling...

07:11.630 --> 07:14.580
I'm gonna clobber him silly
when I get back to normal!

07:21.420 --> 07:23.170
Bottle seller?

07:23.170 --> 07:26.380
Ah, yer probably thinking of
Gosaku the Scarecrow.

07:26.380 --> 07:29.210
But ya better get a move on
if you wanna buy from him.

07:29.210 --> 07:30.960
Cuz Gosaku went
totally bananas earlier today

07:30.960 --> 07:33.080
and started smashin'
all of the bottles he made.

07:33.080 --> 07:33.880
Wha?!

07:34.290 --> 07:37.130
Consarned hunks of junk!

07:37.380 --> 07:39.040
If nobody's gonna buy these stupid bottles,

07:39.040 --> 07:42.000
then I sure as heck ain't makin'
any more! Dangnabbit!

07:42.250 --> 07:44.500
He's at the dump by the edge of the forest.

07:44.500 --> 07:48.170
Said he was gonna be there smashin'
all his bottles til the sun went down.

07:48.170 --> 07:50.290
O-oh no!

07:54.630 --> 07:58.130
Hey boy, yer not gonna
make it at that speed.

07:58.420 --> 07:59.830
Y-you're right!

07:59.830 --> 08:02.920
I better go back and
fetch my scooter instead!

08:03.170 --> 08:05.330
Hey, cutie! Wanna go for drinks?

08:05.330 --> 08:06.540
Get lost, creep!

08:08.380 --> 08:09.710
That's cold!

08:10.080 --> 08:11.500
Hey, doofus!

08:11.500 --> 08:13.250
Have ya seen Lum anywhere?

08:13.250 --> 08:14.460
What do you want, rugrat?

08:14.460 --> 08:16.380
Lum's in big trouble!

08:17.290 --> 08:18.460
<b>TOMOBIKI SHOPPING DISTRICT</b>

08:18.880 --> 08:20.880
Got it? That's the deal!

08:20.880 --> 08:23.750
We've only got until sunset
and the clock is running!

08:23.750 --> 08:25.710
I bet Lum just told you say that, huh?

08:25.710 --> 08:26.540
Ya fathead!

08:26.540 --> 08:31.540
Just listen! I'm gonna go fetch my scooter,
so ya gotta go find Lum and bring her here!

08:31.540 --> 08:32.580
Got that?!

08:36.670 --> 08:37.880
Bunch of BS.

08:39.000 --> 08:40.040
Total lies.

08:40.790 --> 08:42.290
No freakin' way!

08:44.170 --> 08:45.000
Lum!

08:47.960 --> 08:50.290
S-say it ain't so!

08:54.380 --> 08:57.790
Hmph! Don't think you can bully me
just because I'm small!

08:57.790 --> 08:58.710
Lum!

08:58.880 --> 08:59.710
Lum!

08:59.710 --> 09:00.880
Darling?

09:00.880 --> 09:02.040
Come down here.

09:02.040 --> 09:05.040
Nuh-uh! You're just gonna trap me again!

09:05.040 --> 09:06.830
No! Listen to me!

09:06.830 --> 09:09.040
We have to hurry or else
you're gonna be stuck like that!

09:09.040 --> 09:10.580
That's not going to fool me!

09:10.580 --> 09:13.750
You're the one who said that
I was better off being this size!

09:13.750 --> 09:14.830
C'mon, I was just...

09:14.830 --> 09:16.210
Nyeeeeh! No!

09:16.420 --> 09:18.540
Goodness me.
What's all the fuss about?

09:18.540 --> 09:19.040
<b>MURMUR</b>

09:18.920 --> 09:20.330
It's the Moroboshis' kid again...

09:19.040 --> 09:19.880
<b>MURMUR</b>

09:20.330 --> 09:22.750
Please! I'm begging you to come over here!

09:21.750 --> 09:22.960
<b>BOW</b>

09:22.750 --> 09:25.710
No! I can't trust you anymore, darling!

09:25.710 --> 09:27.540
Whatever just... come on!

09:27.170 --> 09:28.420
<b>SWHOOP!</b>

09:28.580 --> 09:31.630
Get your hands off meeeeeee!

09:35.500 --> 09:37.040
Hang on tight!

09:43.670 --> 09:45.540
This is the last one.

09:45.540 --> 09:47.420
Heave-ho!

09:51.540 --> 09:52.580
Is that it?

09:55.540 --> 09:56.790
Good riddance!

09:56.790 --> 10:00.540
DON'T DO IT!

10:20.630 --> 10:21.830
Oh thank god.

10:21.830 --> 10:23.420
You're back to normal!

10:23.420 --> 10:25.460
You're full size again!

10:25.460 --> 10:27.790
Congratulations, Lum!

10:27.790 --> 10:30.130
Whew! What a relief!

10:38.210 --> 10:39.580
So, darling!

10:39.790 --> 10:42.170
How does it feel being stuck in a cage?

10:42.170 --> 10:43.290
Buzz off!

10:59.710 --> 11:01.380
<b>WOOF</b>

11:00.330 --> 11:01.670
<b>BIFF</b>

11:00.330 --> 11:01.670
<b>BAM</b>

11:00.340 --> 11:01.670
<b>POW</b>

11:02.040 --> 11:03.000
A fight?!

11:03.000 --> 11:05.170
They're ganging up on that little guy...

11:05.170 --> 11:06.750
Those jerks!

11:06.750 --> 11:08.580
Hey! Cut it out!

11:08.580 --> 11:09.420
Shoo! Scram!

11:09.420 --> 11:11.380
<b>GRRRRRRRRRRRRRRR</b>

11:23.830 --> 11:25.830
Whew. That was scary.

11:27.040 --> 11:29.500
You're all right now, little pup.

11:39.080 --> 11:41.880
Oh! This is a fox!

11:42.630 --> 11:45.040
<b>When Love Strikes</b>

11:43.040 --> 11:45.040
Here, officer. Please take care of him.

11:45.250 --> 11:47.540
Where did you come from, little guy?

11:47.880 --> 11:49.830
See you! Bye bye!

11:50.580 --> 11:51.790
Yip! Yip!

11:51.790 --> 11:54.040
Whoa there! Just settle down!

11:54.040 --> 11:56.500
I'll be sure to find your owner, okay?

11:59.380 --> 12:01.420
So, tell me where you're from.

12:01.670 --> 12:03.210
Got a name and address?

12:03.460 --> 12:05.540
Just kidding!

12:05.790 --> 12:08.580
Everybody knows foxes can't talk!

12:10.290 --> 12:13.040
He keeps talking to that Jizo statue
like it's a real person...

12:13.040 --> 12:17.040
Having cops like that around makes me worry
about the safety of our neighborhood.

12:21.580 --> 12:22.210
<b>Yip!</b>

12:22.380 --> 12:23.420
Huh?

12:23.790 --> 12:24.330
<b>BA-DUMP!</b>

12:25.920 --> 12:28.330
I thought I heard a fox barking...

12:28.460 --> 12:31.130
<b>THUMP</b>

12:28.750 --> 12:30.210
Guess it was just my imagination.

12:30.210 --> 12:31.130
<b>SWOON</b>

12:32.210 --> 12:33.040
<b>BOUNCE!</b>

12:32.750 --> 12:33.920
Yo, Shinobu!

12:33.920 --> 12:35.750
Oh, hey, Ataru.

12:35.750 --> 12:37.380
Wanna walk home together?

12:42.580 --> 12:43.290
<b>SHOVE</b>

12:45.750 --> 12:48.460
This sucks.
I hate waking up early for class duty...

12:49.130 --> 12:50.710
I'm so sleepy.

12:54.790 --> 12:58.460
<b>THUMP</b>

12:59.330 --> 13:02.040
MISS SHINOBUUUUUUUU!

13:02.040 --> 13:04.750
IT'S ME, THE BOSSMAN
FROM BUTSUMETSU HIGH!

13:04.750 --> 13:06.750
I LOVE YOUUUUUUU!

13:05.670 --> 13:07.670
<b>DASH</b>

13:06.790 --> 13:07.670
<b>EEEEEEEK!</b>

13:07.710 --> 13:08.670
Yip?!

13:12.420 --> 13:12.960
<b>CLENCH!</b>

13:21.080 --> 13:22.710
There's nobody here.

13:22.710 --> 13:24.750
Guess I came too early.

13:26.210 --> 13:30.250
That flower... looks like the one
I threw away with that guy earlier.

13:30.250 --> 13:32.960
Yeah, the same one.

13:35.790 --> 13:37.330
Footprints?

13:37.330 --> 13:38.460
Yo, Shinobu!

13:38.460 --> 13:39.630
Oh, hey, Atar-

13:41.290 --> 13:42.210
Huh?!

13:42.710 --> 13:44.380
It's freezing!

13:44.750 --> 13:46.250
Good morning!

13:46.250 --> 13:48.040
Oh hey! You on class duty today, Shinobu?

13:48.040 --> 13:50.580
Hey everybody! Good morning!

13:50.880 --> 13:52.330
Uh, good morning...

13:52.330 --> 13:53.460
Wassup.

13:54.960 --> 13:56.250
Is something wrong?

13:57.000 --> 13:59.460
Th-the hell is with you?!

14:00.290 --> 14:03.210
Oh c'mon, you guys! It's just me, Ataru!

14:03.540 --> 14:06.460
Say, Shinobu!
Let me help you with class duty!

14:06.460 --> 14:08.750
Huh? Oh no! You don't have to.

14:08.750 --> 14:10.710
Uh oh! The floor is all wet!

14:10.710 --> 14:13.080
Better clean this up before we get in trouble.

14:16.170 --> 14:17.330
So like...

14:17.330 --> 14:18.670
I'll go get a teacher.

14:18.670 --> 14:20.380
G-good idea.

14:21.540 --> 14:22.630
What's going on?

14:22.630 --> 14:24.670
Good morning, Teach!

14:25.540 --> 14:27.420
Yeah, this is weird.

14:27.420 --> 14:29.960
I mean, "Good morning, Teach"?

14:29.960 --> 14:33.170
There's no way Moroboshi
could ever be that polite!

14:33.170 --> 14:35.500
I don't think that's really the problem here...

14:35.500 --> 14:36.880
G'morning.

14:37.250 --> 14:38.330
What's the fuss about?

14:38.330 --> 14:40.210
Well, there's a weirdo in class...

14:40.210 --> 14:41.500
This little guy?

14:41.500 --> 14:43.920
<b>MURMUR MURMUR</b>

14:44.210 --> 14:45.920
What could have happened?

14:47.130 --> 14:48.790
This is strange.

14:48.790 --> 14:50.790
My transformation should be perfect...

14:50.790 --> 14:54.630
I have to do something, or else
they'll figure out that I'm not Ataru.

14:54.630 --> 14:55.830
Hello all.

14:55.830 --> 14:58.040
Has anyone seen my glasses lying around?

14:58.040 --> 14:59.250
Mr. Principal!

14:59.250 --> 15:00.380
Have you seen them?

15:00.380 --> 15:01.710
You came at a good time.

15:01.710 --> 15:03.250
Please look at this.

15:03.830 --> 15:05.750
<b>STAAAAAAAAAAAARE</b>

15:05.920 --> 15:07.880
How about that!

15:07.880 --> 15:09.080
Superb!

15:09.080 --> 15:11.290
I'm stunned, Moroboshi!

15:11.290 --> 15:13.880
The morning floor scrub
on a cold winter morning...

15:13.880 --> 15:17.460
Kids usually hate doing it,
but look at him go.

15:17.830 --> 15:20.960
This must be thanks to all
the guidance you've given him!

15:20.960 --> 15:22.710
S-shucks, I wouldn't say that...

15:22.710 --> 15:25.710
Come now, everyone!
A warm round of applause for Moroboshi!

15:30.380 --> 15:31.830
What's going on, Mendo?

15:31.830 --> 15:35.460
Not sure. Seems like Moroboshi
did something nice for a chance.

15:35.460 --> 15:37.960
Wow, darling! That's so impressive!

15:37.960 --> 15:39.460
Gosh, it was nothing.

15:39.460 --> 15:41.290
Huh? WHAT?!

15:43.250 --> 15:44.670
Wait a sec, Moroboshi...

15:44.670 --> 15:46.420
Hey! Thanks everybody!

15:46.420 --> 15:47.540
Moroboshi?!

15:47.540 --> 15:48.460
Ataru?!

15:48.460 --> 15:49.670
Uh oh.

15:50.290 --> 15:51.880
It's the real Ataru.

15:52.580 --> 15:54.580
H-hey, who are you?!

15:54.580 --> 15:56.250
I could ask the same.

15:56.250 --> 15:57.630
I'm Ataru!

15:57.630 --> 15:58.960
Isn't that right, Shinobu?

15:58.960 --> 16:00.380
The only Ataru is me!

16:01.880 --> 16:03.630
What are you, stupid?

16:03.630 --> 16:05.420
You're not fooling anybody
with that cheap-ass disguise.

16:05.420 --> 16:06.420
Good grief.

16:06.420 --> 16:09.040
It's clear as day which one of you
is the fake!

16:09.040 --> 16:12.210
Now reveal your true form, demon!

16:12.210 --> 16:13.710
YOU JACKASS!

16:15.380 --> 16:17.380
Shinobu! You should get away from him!

16:17.380 --> 16:18.960
Yeah, it's some kind of monster!

16:18.960 --> 16:19.670
Huh?

16:19.670 --> 16:21.920
Quit pretending to be me, you twerp!

16:22.130 --> 16:22.630
<b>WHACK!</b>

16:23.750 --> 16:24.580
